1630 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Creational Design Pattern: The object generation mechanism is addressed by the JavaScript Creational Design Pattern. They aim to make items that are appropriate for a certain scenario. Structural Design Pattern: The JavaScript Structural Design Pattern explains how the classes and objects we've generated so far can be combined to construct bigger frameworks. This pattern makes it easier to create relationships between items by defining a straightforward way to do so. Behavioral Design Pattern: This design pattern highlights typical patterns of communication between objects in JavaScript. As a result, the communication may be carried out with greater freedom.)
/E (Creational Design Pattern: The object generation mechanism is addressed by the JavaScript Creational Design Pattern. They aim to make items that are appropriate for a certain scenario. Structural Design Pattern: The JavaScript Structural Design Pattern explains how the classes and objects we've generated so far can be combined to construct bigger frameworks. This pattern makes it easier to create relationships between items by defining a straightforward way to do so. Behavioral Design Pattern: This design pattern highlights typical patterns of communication between objects in JavaScript. As a result, the communication may be carried out with greater freedom.)
/Pg 67 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
